      "notes": [
        "Restore macOS window dragging through a bounded native move region in the repository tab strip.",
        "Publish collapsed untracked staging targets in the fast opening preview, keep a populated History graph free of loading shimmer while exact status finishes, and let foreground Git operations preempt that background work.",
        "Use one native recursive FSEvents or ReadDirectoryChanges watch instead of walking and registering every non-ignored directory during macOS and Windows repository opening.",
        "Keep active graph filters when navigating from the repository sidebar, revealing only the ancestry needed to connect the selected reference to the filtered graph.",
        "Resume background commit-metadata hydration after graph queries and republish filtered rows as their subjects arrive, preventing message cells from remaining blank after repeated filters."
      ]
